Pull upstream's EchoContainer image from registry.k8s.io instead of the frozen
k8s.gcr.io, pinned by the same SHA-256 digest. GitHub CI builds the image from
the pinned upstream source instead (.github/scripts/run-ingress-arm-pilot.sh).

Apply with `git apply` from the upstream checkout root. Pinned to commit
d920ed36a0076e169a9a329a850844ab3a695ae8 — bumping that SHA in the Makefile
may require re-resolving this patch.

